Package: geneTMEpredict
Type: Package
Title: Random Forest Predictor for Tumor Microenvironment Cell Types and Disease Status
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Xiyao", "Chen", email = "Xiyao.Chen22@student.xjtlu.edu.cn",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides pre-trained random forest models to predict
    single-cell tumor microenvironment cell types (Cancer, T_Cell,
    Fibroblast) and disease status (Tumor vs Healthy_Control)
    from synthetic gene-expression data.
